    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/9357994bb4b216398c1d8b81cd90e5e4.webp?t=1753375309\" /></span><br>Step into the shoes of Dr Vincent Batten, who takes on his new role at the Ministry of Health of the Fifth Republic. Known as a care center for mentally unstable patients, you will find yourself curious, yet intimidated behind the walls of this facility. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/4a4767d9d55cefa1896eb2314a507b7a.poster.avif?t=1753375309\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/4a4767d9d55cefa1896eb2314a507b7a.webm?t=1753375309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/4a4767d9d55cefa1896eb2314a507b7a.mp4?t=1753375309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>In times when the republic is characterized by unrest and riots, it is all the more honourable to tackle such a task.<br>Your family must be proud!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/13975e60a7aed674cf0f785fdce73f52.avif?t=1753375309\" /></span><br><br><i>A Doctor's Term</i> is a story-heavy walking sim featuring stunning environments, thought-provoking narrative and an original soundtrack composed by Manolis Kalpenidis.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/d04784699ca6f88567cf1424bb1fd3d9.webp?t=1753375309\" /></span><br>A confidential adventure where freedom of choice may be bigger than anticipated.<br>Observe your patients, test new samples on them, follow your orders!<br>Are you ready for the job?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/9357994bb4b216398c1d8b81cd90e5e4.webp?t=1753375309\" /></span><br>Step into the shoes of Dr Vincent Batten, who takes on his new role at the Ministry of Health of the Fifth Republic. Known as a care center for mentally unstable patients, you will find yourself curious, yet intimidated behind the walls of this facility. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/4a4767d9d55cefa1896eb2314a507b7a.poster.avif?t=1753375309\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/4a4767d9d55cefa1896eb2314a507b7a.webm?t=1753375309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/4a4767d9d55cefa1896eb2314a507b7a.mp4?t=1753375309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>In times when the republic is characterized by unrest and riots, it is all the more honourable to tackle such a task.<br>Your family must be proud!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/13975e60a7aed674cf0f785fdce73f52.avif?t=1753375309\" /></span><br><br><i>A Doctor's Term</i> is a story-heavy walking sim featuring stunning environments, thought-provoking narrative and an original soundtrack composed by Manolis Kalpenidis.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529050/extras/d04784699ca6f88567cf1424bb1fd3d9.webp?t=1753375309\" /></span><br>A confidential adventure where freedom of choice may be bigger than anticipated.<br>Observe your patients, test new samples on them, follow your orders!<br>Are you ready for the job?",
